			"notes": "## What's New\n\n- Crimsonite Ore now spawns naturally in the overworld\n- Y range: -64 to 16 (trapezoid distribution, peaks around Y=-24)\n- Spawns in both stone and deepslate layers\n- Implemented data-driven with no Java code (NeoForge biome modifier)\n\n## Installation\nDrop `crimsonite-1.21.1-1.1.0.jar` into your `mods/` folder.\nRequires NeoForge 21.1.x for Minecraft 1.21.1.\n\n> **Note:** Ore only generates in newly loaded chunks. Existing worlds require exploring new terrain."
